{"asset_key":"ep2/env_story_12303110","episode":"ep2","category":"env_story","story_id":"12303110","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1230311001:1":{"text":"생선 수프만 아니면 뭐든 다 좋아.","source_cn":"什么都好，只要不是鱼肉汤。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4AA0B2935F8826FE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1230311002:1":{"text":"맨날 생선이야. 온갖 생선에 홍합찜까지! 로즈마리와 레몬즙을 뿌리고 버터에 구운 소고기가 먹고 싶어...!","source_cn":"每天都是鱼。大大小小的鱼，还有蒸蚌。我想吃大块的牛肉！...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6F173F60963423A9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1230311003:1":{"text":"그런 게 먹고 싶다고? 참나, 꿈 깨!","source_cn":"这就是你想吃的？嗯？想得美！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4F8AA049976401BC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1230311004:1":{"text":"러스트 항에 식재료가 들어오지 않는 한 내일도 모레도, 그리고 그 뒤에도 저녁 식탁에는 계속 생선만 올라갈 거야. 먹든 말든 마음대로 해!","source_cn":"锈锚港还没运来食料，明天，后天，以及之后的晚餐，还会是...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE790A4ABA97A513C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:血薇帮阿尔伯特":{"text":"블러디 로즈 앨버트","source":"血薇帮阿尔伯特","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:血薇帮库克薇":{"text":"블러디 로즈 쿠기","source":"血薇帮库克薇","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":2}}